Plated Pipe was added in '''Beta 51.0''' as a 6/5 for 8G Armor monster that would add a [[Mines|Mine]] to the enemy's deck every time it takes DMG. '''Beta 53.0''' changed Armor, but this only caused a wording change for Plated Pipe. '''Beta 54.1''' gave it -1 cost and ATK, changed its Armor to only take 1 less DMG during the enemy's turn (so temporary Armor without actually having Armor) and instead of adding a Mine, it will deal 2 DMG to the opponent right away.

=== Stats ===
ATK:

* 6 (Post Beta 51.0)
* 5 (Post Beta 54.1, Current)

HP: 5

Cost:

* 8 (Post Beta 51.0)
* 7 (Post Beta 54.1, Current)

Abilities:

* Armor (1). Whenever this takes DMG, add a Mine to the enemy's deck. (Post Beta 51.0)
* Armor. Whenever this takes DMG, add a Mine to the enemy's deck. (Post Beta 53.0)
** '''[Unchanged. Updated wording due to Armor rework.]'''
* Takes 1 less DMG during the enemy's turn. Whenever this takes DMG, deal 2 DMG to the enemy. (Post Beta 54.1, Current)

Rarity: Purple (Epic)
